Optional offline transcription assets for SiloCityLabs/recording

This directory vendors (or hosts after fetch) the following third-party works,
each under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt):

1. vosk-browser
   Copyright (c) Ciaran O'Reilly and contributors
   https://github.com/ccoreilly/vosk-browser
   Version: 0.0.8
   File: vosk.js

2. Per-language Vosk small models (Alphacephei)
   https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models
   Files (gzipped tar, Apache-2.0):
   - vosk-model-small-en-us-0.15.tar.gz  (English US)
   - vosk-model-small-en-gb-0.15.tar.gz  (English UK)
   - vosk-model-small-es-0.42.tar.gz     (Spanish)
   - vosk-model-small-fr-0.22.tar.gz     (French)
   - vosk-model-small-de-0.15.tar.gz     (German)

Only one language model is downloaded to the device at a time (plus vosk.js).
Switching transcription language in Settings replaces the stored model.

Vosk builds on Kaldi speech recognition software. See upstream projects for the
full contributor notices.
